github-desktop-linux
====================

This repository redistributes a Linux build of GitHub Desktop. It is an
unofficial, community-maintained package and is NOT affiliated with, endorsed
by, or supported by GitHub, Inc.

The distributed binary package (`github-desktop_3.5.13~beta1-1_amd64.deb`)
contains software owned and copyrighted by its respective upstream authors,
redistributed here under the terms of the MIT License.

